  "description": "<p>The resolution to this ticket should either resolve the follow Fedora API Test Suite failures, or create follow-on tickets for their resolution.</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpc\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpc</a><br/>\nLDP Containers must distinguish <span class=\"error\">&#91;membership&#93;</span> triples.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpdc\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpdc</a><br/>\nImplementations MUST set the ldp:membershipResource by default when not specified on creation.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpdc\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpdc</a><br/>\nImplementations SHOULD set the ldp:membershipResource to the LDPC by default when not specified on creation.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpdc\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpdc</a><br/>\nImplementations must allow the membership predicate to be set by default to an implementation defined value.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpdc\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fedora.info/2018/11/22/spec/#ldpdc</a><br/>\nImplementations should use the default &lt;&gt; ldp:hasMemberRelation ldp:member</li>\n</ul>\n\n",
